      "side": 1,
      "message": "I do not see a `find_get_task_struct()` function anywhere in the kernel tree.\n\nAnd again, this should not be needed for any normal operation.\n\nUnwinding the task stack is fragile and prone to change in tricky ways, it is not a \"stable\" api that we can support, nor should you attempt to rely on it for any type of functionality.",
